    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "de684db5_85821e9b",
        "filename": "src/codec/SkPngCodecBase.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 210,
      "author": {
        "id": 4772438
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T17:20:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because it’s in the base class (and covers both decoders), I’m a bit warry about doing this change here (e.g. libpng doesn’t track the caller memory budget atm, IIRC only the JPEG codec does)\n\nI’d say it’d probably a good idea to do this in a follow-up CL, WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "87d10dab_a7ae72f9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "46501b5d3261344792e134fa2f87d83493f56400",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e866c1e_fda35ece",
        "filename": "src/codec/SkPngCodecBase.cpp",
