        "id": 4772438
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T17:43:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like there are other vector allocations in the Rust codec too, I think it’d be good to at least cover these too (up to you if you prefer we do that here or in a follow-up)",
      "parentUuid": "de684db5_85821e9b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 12,
